 "segments": [
  {
   "s": 0.0,
   "e": 5.98,
   "t": "The gentlest nurse on the ward, and America's most prolific killer, Autumn of 2003."
  },
  {
   "s": 6.82,
   "e": 9.24,
   "t": "At Somerset Medical Center in Somerville, New Jersey."
  },
  {
   "s": 10.34,
   "e": 15.46,
   "t": "The 43-year-old man possessed a frail frame, spoke in a quiet murmur, always greeted colleagues"
  },
  {
   "s": 15.46,
   "e": 19.8,
   "t": "with a gentle smile, and eagerly volunteered to cover shifts for exhausted co-workers."
  },
  {
   "s": 16.5,
   "e": 19.84,
   "t": "and eagerly volunteered to cover shifts for exhausted co-workers."
  },
  {
   "s": 20.6,
   "e": 24.3,
   "t": "Yet, beneath that pristine white scrubs lay a lethal halo effect"
  },
  {
   "s": 24.3,
   "e": 28.18,
   "t": "that concealed a terrifying psychological abyss for 16 long years."
  },
  {
   "s": 29.18,
   "e": 32.2,
   "t": "He was always the first to rush in whenever a patient deteriorated"
  },
  {
   "s": 32.2,
   "e": 36.12,
   "t": "and quietly stayed behind to tidy up the room after failed resuscitations."
  },
  {
   "s": 33.0,
   "e": 36.2,
   "t": "stayed behind to tidy up the room after failed resuscitations."
  },
  {
   "s": 36.88,
   "e": 42.04,
   "t": "To all of us nurses at Somerset Medical Center, Charlie was simply an incredible friend."
  },
  {
   "s": 43.18,
   "e": 48.1,
   "t": "He was considerate, never lost his temper, and cared for patients with exceptional gentleness."
  },
  {
   "s": 48.92,
   "e": 53.36,
   "t": "Until the truth broke open, all of us felt a chill down our spines upon"
  },
  {
   "s": 49.5,
   "e": 54.22,
   "t": "Until the truth broke open, all of us felt a chill down our spines, upon realizing we"
  },
  {
   "s": 54.22,
   "e": 57.68,
   "t": "had worked alongside one of the most prolific serial killers in history."
  },
  {
   "s": 58.52,
   "e": 63.26,
   "t": "Through the lens of criminal psychology, Charles Cullen exhibited classic hallmarks"
  },
  {
   "s": 63.26,
   "e": 67.22,
   "t": "of psychological, objectification, and severe dehumanization."
  },
  {
   "s": 67.92,
   "e": 69.66,
   "t": "Episode 4 of Amber Eyes"
  },
  {
   "s": 51.84,
   "e": 57.7,
   "t": "down our spines, upon realizing we had worked alongside one of the most prolific serial killers in history."
  },
  {
   "s": 58.54,
   "e": 67.22,
   "t": "Through the lens of criminal psychology, Charles Cullen exhibited classic hallmarks of psychological, objectification, and severe dehumanization."
  },
  {
